From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: misc-de <misc-de@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 04 Nov 2026 08:06:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] aod: The same place for the whole minute

The content moves to a random place against burn-in. The always-on display is
made anew when the phone locks while it dozes, and the new one jumped to another
place in the middle of the minute. Take the place from the minute, so that any
always-on display within one minute shows the same picture.
---
 src/aod.c | 6 ++++--
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/aod.c b/src/aod.c
index 5c038143..217956be 100644
--- a/src/aod.c
+++ b/src/aod.c
@@ -73,11 +73,13 @@ static const char aod_css[] =
 static void
 move_content (PhoshAod *self)
 {
+  /* The minute decides: the always-on display made anew when the phone locks stays in place */
+  g_autoptr (GRand) rand = g_rand_new_with_seed (g_get_real_time () / (60 * G_USEC_PER_SEC));
   int height, dx, dy;
 
   /* A new random place each minute, within a small box around the middle */
-  dx = g_random_int_range (-AOD_SHIFT_X, AOD_SHIFT_X + 1);
-  dy = g_random_int_range (0, AOD_SHIFT_Y + 1);
+  dx = g_rand_int_range (rand, -AOD_SHIFT_X, AOD_SHIFT_X + 1);
+  dy = g_rand_int_range (rand, 0, AOD_SHIFT_Y + 1);
 
   height = gtk_widget_get_allocated_height (GTK_WIDGET (self));
   if (height <= 1 && self->monitor)
